<title>USA: Banyan Strategic buys Kentucky property.</title>
<headline>Banyan Strategic buys Kentucky property.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banyan Strategic Realty Trust said Wednesday that on November 19 it acquired a single-story industrial building in Jefferson County, Ky., southwest of Louisville, for $9.9 million.</p>
<p>The property represents the trust's 15th acquisition since starting its investment program in 1993.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
